===Etymology===
From {{der|en|ky|Кыргызстан}}, from {{suf|nocat=1|ky|кыргыз|t1=Kyrgyz|-стан|t2=-stan}}. Equivalent to {{suf|en|Kyrgyz|-stan}}. More at {{l|en|Kyrgyz}}.

